# REQUIREMENTS: cu-001

Deliver criterion 4 at the type level and lay the immutable type groundwork for criteria 5 and 6. Add an Advisor-authored justification to the Hypothesis value and define the report vocabulary: StageDecision, BreakpointView, LedgerStageReport and ExaminationOutcome. The justification default keeps older five-argument call sites compiling until they are amended by cu-005; a blank value fails closed at evaluation time in cu-002. Depends on: nothing.
